Package: rstudiochat
Type: Package
Title: Chat Sidebar for RStudio
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("RStudio", "Chat", email = "dev@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A Copilot/Claude-style chat panel for RStudio that connects to
    Anthropic- or OpenAI-compatible LLM providers and runs a tool-use agent
    that can inspect and control the R session via the rstudioapi.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    httpuv,
    httr2,
    jsonlite,
    utils
